{
	"_about": "PROPOSAL (Sal, 2026-10-31), read by nothing. Town data for the first island in the shapes the NPC code already reads: `npcs` rows are npcs.json entries (24 hourly package slots), `markers` are markers.json entries (coordinates next to the existing beds and chairs at x 53296..53306, z 68422..68424; y comes from the ground), `outfits` are outfits.json entries (items with worn.json rows), dialogue files and voices are Mandy's (voices reuse hob and edda until new ones are cast). Shops: data/npcs/shops_proposal.json. NEW shape for Tyler: `jobs` = the jobs board, each job {id, giver NPC, title, text, take (an [item, n] or a list of them the player hands over), reward {coin_copper, item?, rep?}, repeat_game_days (cooldown per player), rank (reputation rank needed)}. A job is offered by the giver's dialogue (effect set_flag on accept, take_item/give_item on turn-in) or by a board object; the existing dialogue effects (take_item, give_item, add_rep, set_flag) already cover the turn-in, so the board is data plus a list screen. `buildings` is a layout list for the world builder, made only from kits the player can also craft.",
